# Sample LSP Hover Request

File: ooda/lsp/examples/hover_request.oot

## Request

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "textDocument/hover",
  "params": {
    "textDocument": {"uri": "file:///home/user/project/main.oo"},
    "position": {"line": 7, "character": 5}
  }
}
```

## Expected Response (abbreviated)

```json
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "result": {
    "contents": {
      "kind": "markdown",
      "value": "## pub fn divide\n\nLogline: ...\n\nSetup: ...\n\nBeats:\n1. ...\n\n```ooda\npub fn divide(a: Float, b: Float) -> Float\n```"
    }
  }
}
```

The hover content prepends the Academy 4-element header (parsed from the source file) to the canonical symbol's signature and doc.
